{"text": "TO: MY CO-WORKERS\nFROM: ML. Orlowsky\n\nDATE: February 11, 1999\n\nAs you may have heard, on Tuesday a San Francisco jury entered a\nverdict in favor of the plaintiff in Henley, an individual smoking and health\ncase tried against Philip Morris only. The jury awarded $1.5 million in\ncompensatory damages. Yesterday after further argument, the jury awarded\n$50 million in punitive damages. As the attached press release issued by\nPhilip Morris indicates, Philip Morris intends to appeal both the verdict and the\npunitive damage award. In previous smoking and health cases in which a\ntobacco manufacturer has been found liable at trial, those verdicts have been\noverturned on appeal or new trials ordered. We are hopeful that the appeal in\nHenley will be equally successful. Lorillard Tobacco Company was not a\ndefendant in the Henley case. Of course, we will continue to defend vigorously\nall lawsuits in which Lorillard is named.\n\nMLO:lak\nAttachment WLS\n\nvLE9Z%6S8", "words": [{"text": "TO:", "x0": 90, "y0": 225, "x1": 117, "y1": 253, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "MY", "x0": 178, "y0": 234, "x1": 202, "y1": 244, "conf": 86.0}, {"text": "CO-WORKERS", "x0": 206, "y0": 233, "x1": 309, "y1": 244, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "FROM:", "x0": 94, "y0": 266, "x1": 141, "y1": 277, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "ML.", "x0": 179, "y0": 266, "x1": 212, "y1": 277, "conf": 32.0}, {"text": "Orlowsky", "x0": 218, "y0": 266, "x1": 282, "y1": 280, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "DATE:", "x0": 94, "y0": 299, "x1": 137, "y1": 310, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "February", "x0": 179, "y0": 299, "x1": 241, "y1": 313, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "11,", "x0": 247, "y0": 299, "x1": 266, "y1": 312, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "1999", "x0": 274, "y0": 299, "x1": 305, "y1": 310, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "As", "x0": 136, "y0": 367, "x1": 153, "y1": 377, "conf": 87.0}, {"text": "you", "x0": 157, "y0": 369, "x1": 182, "y1": 380, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "may", "x0": 187, "y0": 369, "x1": 216, "y1": 380, "conf": 96.0}, {"tex